---
// Featured Book — "I'll Show Papi... I Know My ABCs"
---

<section id="featured" class="featured">
  <div class="container feat-inner">
    <div class="feat-cover">
      <div class="cover-frame">
        <img
          src="/images/abcs-cover.png"
          alt="Book cover: I'll Show Papi… I Know My ABCs"
          width="360"
          height="440"
          loading="lazy"
          onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';"
        />
        <div class="cover-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>📖</span>
          <p>I'll Show Papi…<br />I Know My ABCs</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="book-tag">Book 1 of the Series</div>
    </div>

    <div class="feat-text">
      <p class="section-label">Featured Book</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        I'll Show Papi…<br />I Know My ABCs
      </h2>
      <p class="section-body">
        In this debut title, a bright young child is ready to prove something
        special — they know every letter of the alphabet! Join the adventure as
        each page bursts with color, confidence, and the heartwarming moment of
        showing Papi just how much they've learned.
      </p>

      <ul class="book-details">
        <li><strong>Ages:</strong> 2 – 6</li>
        <li><strong>Format:</strong> Hardcover &amp; Paperback</li>
        <li><strong>Pages:</strong> 32</li>
        <li><strong>Reading Level:</strong> Pre-K / Kindergarten</li>
      </ul>

      <a href="#buy" class="btn btn-primary">🛒 Get Your Copy</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .featured {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #f0fafb 0%, #e6f9f8 100%);
  }

  .feat-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Cover */
  .feat-cover {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cover-frame {
    width: 280px;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow), 0 0 0 6px var(--color-sky);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #e8e0d4;
    min-height: 340px;
  }

  .cover-frame img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
  }

  .cover-placeholder {
    display: none;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 340px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4ecdc4, #1a9e96);
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cover-placeholder span {
    font-size: 4rem;
  }

  .cover-placeholder p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .book-tag {
    background: var(--color-sky);
    color: var(--color-navy);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 3rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  /* Text */
  .book-details {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .book-details li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .book-details strong {
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .feat-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .feat-cover {
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .book-details {
      max-width: 320px;
      margin-inline: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
